      We handle design, secure local UK hosting, and monthly maintenance. Get in touch to discuss
      your goals with our friendly team.
    </p>

    <div data-reveal="fade" data-reveal-delay="130" class="pt-2">
      <button
        type="button"
        data-open-enquiry
        aria-label="Begin the online enquiry form"
        class="bg-brand-teal hover:bg-brand-teal-dark text-white font-bold text-sm px-10 py-4 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-brand-teal cursor-pointer border-none uppercase tracking-widest font-mono inline-flex items-center gap-3 mx-auto hover-button-polish decoration-none"
      >
        <svg
          aria-hidden="true"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="w-4 h-4 text-white animate-pulse"
        >
          <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line>
          <polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon>
        </svg>
        <span>Begin Online Enquiry</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <noscript>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
        JavaScript is disabled. Email{" "}
        <strong class="font-bold text-brand-teal select-all">septen.digital@gmail.com</strong>{" "}
        to enquire directly.
      </p>
    </noscript>
  </div>
</section>
